  "description": "BANHALMI is a strategic visual partner for executives, founders, experts, professionals, artists, actors, creative professionals, teams and organisations. Executive portraiture and brand photography are individually positioned around the person, generational and career-stage context, leadership level, role, professional field, stakeholder audience, usage channels, market context and intended perception. Different roles need different visual authority; there is no universal executive look.",
